<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Sept car registrations rise 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Sept car registrations rise 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle registrations rose a seasonally-adjusted 0.2 percent in September to 54,290, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists median forecast had been for a fall of around 0.8 percent.</p>
</text>
